reprepro
------------------------------------------
This project is a leightweight feature complete manager of a debian package
(i.e. binary .deb and source .dsc+.tar.gz+.diff.gz) repository.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libarchive13-3.8.11-1
  libdb18.1-18.1.40-1
  libgpg-error0-1.61-1
  libgpgme45-2.2.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libarchive-devel-3.8.11-1
  libdb-devel-18.1.40-1
  libgpg-error-devel-1.61-1
  libgpgme-devel-2.2.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://salsa.debian.org/debian/reprepro

Canonical download:
  mirror://debian/pool/main/r/reprepro/reprepro_5.5.1.orig.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack reprepro-5.5.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./reprepro-5.5.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/reprepro-5.5.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/reprepro-5.5.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(reprepro)
  /usr/bin/changestool.exe
  /usr/bin/reprepro.exe
  /usr/bin/rredtool.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/reprepro.README
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/HACKING
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/README
  /usr/share/doc/reprepro/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/changestool.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/reprepro.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/rredtool.1.gz

